[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0010","text":"……白得让人受不了……──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0020","text":"到底合不合身啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0030","text":"（──这是）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0040","text":"（又可爱、又帅气、闪闪发光……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0050","text":"（只有充满魅力的女孩子才能成为的、特别存在专属的服装）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0060","text":"──……与这完全相反的小冬，能驾驭得了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0070","text":"……这种问题，问了也是白问"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0080","text":"既然决定要穿\n那就一定要穿出效果来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0090","text":"没关系，小冬的话一定没问题……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0100","text":"──扑腾乱跳的丑态，绝对不让你看到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11800100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
